  <TITLE>Feruloyl esterase producing prokaryotes in anaerobic and microaerobic ecosystems</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>In this study we applied whole genome shotgun metagenomics and genome binning to screen prokaryotes in anaerobic and microaerobic ecosystems for possession of feruloyl esterase genes.</DESCRIPTION>
